WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.920
Get your code from the welcome page with
your purchase email.

00:04.320 --> 00:06.280
Then enter it here in Settings.

00:06.980 --> 00:11.240
Type in the 6-digit code, and tap Connect
my companion.

00:11.800 --> 00:14.820
Once it connects, your companion is ready
to chat.

00:15.360 --> 00:17.420
A code works for 24 hours.

00:17.420 --> 00:19.620
On the device you enter it on.

00:20.260 --> 00:23.980
If it expires, request a fresh one from
the welcome page.

